{"id":"vod_sn_35851","vodId":"35851","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"戏剧性谋杀","name_cn":"戏剧性谋杀","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/65d510b8f5f4b6a1a56210e5736e6d25.jpg"},"summary":"故事背景为架空世界“碧岛”，这座位于日本列岛西南方的岛屿，被财团改造成宏大华丽的白金牢笼。本作主人公是濑良垣苍叶（私市淳 配音），在旧住民区一家“平凡”商店里打工，犬型智能伴侣“莲”常伴其左右，好友红雀（高桥广树 配音）亦对其照顾有加。然而从以前开始，苍叶就一直忍受着原因不明的头痛。同时，岛内又开始流行起一种虚拟对战游戏——“莱姆”。一向对此毫无兴趣的苍叶，某天在送货路上，突然被一名神秘人物拉入了莱姆的异空间内，强制进行对战。头痛的日渐加剧，背负着的沉重过去；神秘人物连番登场，都市传说“神隐”再现，苍叶看似平静的生活，正悄然发生了变化。　　本动画改编自Nitro   CHiRAL于2012年发售的一款BL向AVG游戏。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t1RBfZY7Wk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/du6wnLXhfa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TJ6eM2Ha1e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GscE5f0dib1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x0Fp11TFsJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/geuG1xBKcD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VFdgMqYjYW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VAD4fJuvPf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NFRRVHaCe81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iQLCNtARBb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VQsVL1EWRD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4br0dvZxBe1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.899Z"}